					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-semibold">
						"Bought my golf cart from Masters Golf Cars for use in Ocala Palms. The staff was knowledgeable and helped me find the perfect cart for my needs. Great service!"
					</p>
					<p class="font-black text-gray-900">-Robert M., Ocala Palms</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-100">
					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-semibold">
						"Excellent experience buying our golf cart. They understood our needs for Golden Ocala and recommended the perfect Club Car. Highly recommend!"
					</p>
					<p class="font-black text-gray-900">-Sarah K., Golden Ocala</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-100">
					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-semibold">
						"Found a great used golf cart at Masters Golf Cars. The financing was easy and the cart has been perfect for getting around Woodfields. Great dealership!"
					</p>
					<p class="font-black text-gray-900">-Mike T., Woodfields</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
